WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.931
Project A uses subqueries to build a patient-level
feature table Each

00:00:05.957 --> 00:00:12.667
patient receives an admission count abnormal-lab
count and distinct-medication count The

00:00:12.694 --> 00:00:18.579
query then combines those features into a simple
teaching score The score

00:00:18.592 --> 00:00:24.241
is not a clinical model The SQL lesson is to create
features at one

00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:27.241
clear grain and then calculate a derived value from
them
